{"messages":[{"content":"Interpret the AST exactly: const is a literal; var reads event.status, event.amount, state.x or state.y. eq/ne/ge/gt/le/lt compare two arguments without coercion; all/any combine boolean arguments; not negates one. For each event, evaluate rule and precondition on the current state; execute only when both are true. Otherwise keep state unchanged. add increases source by amount; scale multiplies source by amount; transfer simultaneously subtracts from source and adds to destination; swap exchanges source and destination simultaneously. Signed balances are allowed unless the stated precondition forbids them. Ignore annotation. Execute events in given sequence.\nReturn JSON {after: final_state} only.\nTask JSON:\n{\"kind\":\"causal\",\"state\":{\"x\":1500,\"y\":2900},\"rule\":{\"op\":\"not\",\"args\":[{\"op\":\"not\",\"args\":[{\"op\":\"all\",\"args\":[{\"op\":\"ne\",\"args\":[{\"var\":\"event.status\"},{\"const\":\"xelth\"}]},{\"op\":\"gt\",\"args\":[{\"var\":\"state.x\"},{\"const\":1500}]}]}]}]},\"precondition\":{\"const\":true},\"events\":[{\"status\":\"xelth\",\"amount\":500,\"op\":\"transfer\",\"source\":\"x\",\"destination\":\"y\"},{\"status\":\"posted\",\"amount\":501,\"op\":\"scale\",\"source\":\"y\",\"destination\":\"x\"},{\"status\":\"xelth\",\"amount\":502,\"op\":\"swap\",\"source\":\"x\",\"destination\":\"y\"},{\"status\":\"pending\",\"amount\":503,\"op\":\"add\",\"source\":\"y\",\"destination\":\"x\"}],\"annotation\":\"weather record: cloudy\"}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"after\":{\"x\":1500,\"y\":2900}}","role":"assistant"}]}
